From f30b5714d5297042aa63e97d38bb75b2dcaea2f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 02:34:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] fix(registry): make request_delete and release_allocation
 compare-and-swap

request_delete read the row and then wrote Terminating (or physically deleted)
without checking resource_version, so a write committed in between was lost, or
a finalizer added in between was bypassed. release_allocation likewise could
rewrite an allocation that had just expired.

Condition both writes on the version/status that was read and raise
ConflictError when another writer got there first.
